        "slc_f3030110f92fdedcf1ea5fab1e568600b8d7652af253c33749b8bcf11d0b83b8"
      ],
      "text": "The product is a local AI agent desktop application for macOS and Windows that packages the pi agent's capabilities into a standalone installable app."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fda93dedc2fe9dc44c65e97d701d8b60eb075c4e637b7c5a3679bcde06471f56",
